        <mxCell id="legenda" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#CCCCCC;spacing=8;fontSize=12;rounded=1;roundedPerimeter=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;Legenda&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;font color=&#39;#C8102E&#39;&gt;PK&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt; chave primária &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; &lt;font color=&#39;#1F5FAD&#39;&gt;FK&lt;/font&gt; chave estrangeira &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; &lt;font color=&#39;#888888&#39;&gt;U&lt;/font&gt; único &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; &lt;font color=&#39;#888888&#39;&gt;gerada&lt;/font&gt; coluna calculada&lt;br&gt;Cardinalidade &lt;b&gt;(mín,máx)&lt;/b&gt; em cada ponta da linha: (1,1) exatamente um · (0,1) zero ou um · (0,N) zero ou muitos&lt;br&gt;Pé de galinha: &lt;b&gt;|&lt;/b&gt; = obrigatório, &lt;b&gt;o&lt;/b&gt; = opcional, &lt;b&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/b&gt; = muitos · linhas ligam FK → PK" vertex="1">
